1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Santa — a gift in one link.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Make a token gift feel personal.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Choose a token. Add a note. Share a private link.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Create a fresh gift of 25 valueless TEST tokens.

5
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Add an encrypted note and choose an expiry.

6
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:44,000
The sender signs the NEAR Testnet deposit in Meteor.

7
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:52,000
The private link opens the gift and its personal note.

8
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Connect recipient.santa-gifts.testnet to claim.

9
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:09,000
The recipient authorizes this claim with NEP-413.

10
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:16,000
The relayer submits the claim. The gift is delivered.

11
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:23,000
25 TEST received. No NEAR spent by the recipient.

12
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:35,000
Final callback: true. A repeated claim returns HTTP 409.

13
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:42,000
Santa. Built at NEAR HACKATHON. NEAR Testnet only.
